  _subtitlesData:
  - _text: Kiss me, ki-ki-kiss me
    _timeStamp: 0
  - _text: Infect me with your lovin', fill me with your poison
    _timeStamp: 3.3
  - _text: Take me, ta-ta-take me
    _timeStamp: 6.54
  - _text: Wanna be your victim, ready for abduction
    _timeStamp: 9.9
  - _text: Omg, look at her new music video!
    _timeStamp: 12.638
  - _text: She loves aliens!
    _timeStamp: 14.5
  - _text: Bring her here.
    _timeStamp: 17.1
  - _text: "That\u2019s what I\u2019m saying."
    _timeStamp: 19.394
  - _text: I think artists are who we will have to reach for
    _timeStamp: 20.938
  - _text: To find out how to touch the sense
    _timeStamp: 25.108
  - _text: Of aliens we have yet to imagine.
    _timeStamp: 27.986
  - _text: Welcome aboard Katy Perry!
    _timeStamp: 43.794
  - _text: I need to, I want to hear about your alien love.
    _timeStamp: 56.098
  - _text: I mean,
    _timeStamp: 59.935
  - _text: "You\u2019ve given some love to aliens in ET."
    _timeStamp: 60.042
  - _text: "I mean, I don\u2019t know. When you see all the movies, you think"
    _timeStamp: 62.294
  - _text: You know, when they send the guy to like, meet the aliens
    _timeStamp: 65.422
  - _text: "Like here\u2019s a baseball, here\u2019s what we represent."
    _timeStamp: 68.592
  - _text: "Here\u2019s like the flag, and a picture of family,"
    _timeStamp: 72.221
  - _text: "And here\u2019s pop music."
    _timeStamp: 75.557
  - _text: "And I\u2019m like \u201CHey, can you just bring that song\u201D"
    _timeStamp: 77.267
  - _text: "As like \u201CWe love you!\u201D"
    _timeStamp: 80.229
  - _text: "Like \u201CWe want to be\u2026 whatever\u201D. Wow."
    _timeStamp: 83.232
  - _text: '[ET Bridge playing]'
    _timeStamp: 90
  - _text: Your captain is hot.
    _timeStamp: 97.371
  - _text: You need to set me up with him.
    _timeStamp: 99.581
  - _text: 'Gay alien: You got it gurl.'
    _timeStamp: 102.834
  - _text: "Aliens: Yeah, that\u2019ll please him."
    _timeStamp: 111.134
  - _text: 'Gay alien: Slay.'
    _timeStamp: 113.095
  - _text: "I\u2019m still asking you about ET."
    _timeStamp: 117.057
  - _text: Oh, ok alright.
    _timeStamp: 118.934
  - _text: You wrote a song about ET.
    _timeStamp: 120.209
  - _text: "I know, but that\u2019s it, it was just a metaphor."
    _timeStamp: 121.752
  - _text: I believe in it and everything.
    _timeStamp: 124.129
  - _text: "The words didn\u2019t sound very metaphorical to me."
    _timeStamp: 125.505
  - _text: "I don\u2019t know if I would actually have intercourse with one of them."
    _timeStamp: 127.758
  - _text: "Unless they were like\u2026"
    _timeStamp: 130.594
  - _text: That was one of your lines! I wanna have sex with an alien!
    _timeStamp: 131.386
  - _text: "But I also say thing like Bon Appetit, you know\u2026"
    _timeStamp: 134.348
  - _text: Wait wait, excuse me.
    _timeStamp: 139.686
  - _text: "\u201CBon Appetit\u201D and \u201CI wanna have sex with an alien\u201D"
    _timeStamp: 140.979
  - _text: These are not equivalent sentences.
    _timeStamp: 143.357
  - _text: Well, meaning I was using food as an analogy
    _timeStamp: 145.15
  - _text: A way of speaking.
    _timeStamp: 148.278
  - _text: "And then I was using\u2026"
    _timeStamp: 149.655
  - _text: I use words like double entendres
    _timeStamp: 152.324
  - _text: And puns, and things like that.
    _timeStamp: 154.868
  - _text: Ok, I would have thought so, except the whole song was that!
    _timeStamp: 156.995
  - _text: You're from a whole 'nother world
    _timeStamp: 159.164
  - _text: A different dimension
    _timeStamp: 163.085
  - _text: You open my eyes
    _timeStamp: 166.255
  - _text: And I'm ready to go, lead me into the light
    _timeStamp: 169.466
  - _text: Why are there 7 billion people
    _timeStamp: 173.011
  - _text: And why does each one of us
    _timeStamp: 175.764
  - _text: Have our own fingerprint?
    _timeStamp: 178.767
  - _text: Even twins have different fingerprints.
    _timeStamp: 182.211
  - _text: Who are otherwise genetically identical.
    _timeStamp: 185.589
  - _text: Why?
    _timeStamp: 187.466
  - _text: Would you rather we were all the same?
    _timeStamp: 188.634
  - _text: "Clone: I\u2019m Katy Perry. I\u2019m 32 years old."
    _timeStamp: 195.641
  - _text: "I\u2019m a pop sensation."
    _timeStamp: 205.067
  - _text: "I\u2019m currently working on my album Witness."
    _timeStamp: 206.318
  - _text: "Here\u2019s something that freaks me out every day."
    _timeStamp: 215.786
  - _text: Every morning I wake up and I say
    _timeStamp: 217.663
  - _text: "\u201CHow is it that every morning I wake up as me?\u201D"
    _timeStamp: 219.957
  - _text: "\u201CAnd not as someone else?\u201D"
    _timeStamp: 222.626
  - _text: Oh yeah! I have that feeling.
    _timeStamp: 223.627
  - _text: "Like \u201Cthis is weird being me\u201D"
    _timeStamp: 226.505
  - _text: "\u201CWhat is it like being you?\u201D"
    _timeStamp: 228.59
  - _text: "Right! That\u2019s what I\u2019m saying!"
    _timeStamp: 229.8
  - _text: "It\u2019s like \u201CWhy am I me every day?\u201D"
    _timeStamp: 230.676
  - _text: Why!
    _timeStamp: 232.469
  - _text: How does that happen?
    _timeStamp: 233.011
  - _text: '[Explosion noises]'
    _timeStamp: 234.137
  - _text: So, would you
    _timeStamp: 242.044
  - _text: If an alien came, would you
    _timeStamp: 243.42
  - _text: Wanna sing to it or talk to it?
    _timeStamp: 244.713
  - _text: Only if it would wanna talk and sing to me.
    _timeStamp: 247.633
  - _text: I mean not sing to me, but just like
    _timeStamp: 251.303
  - _text: "I think it would be more like\u2026"
    _timeStamp: 253.388
  - _text: I would just listen.
    _timeStamp: 255.307
  - _text: "I would just try, and\u2026"
    _timeStamp: 257.476
  - _text: You are the first person ever to say that.
    _timeStamp: 260.312
  - _text: Why?
    _timeStamp: 263.315
  - _text: "That\u2019s beautiful."
    _timeStamp: 264.272
  - _text: '[Singing]'
    _timeStamp: 265.484
  - _text: "Don\u2019t sayyyyyy, goodbye."
    _timeStamp: 270.906
  - _text: Delighted to learn that Katy Perry loves space aliens!
    _timeStamp: 278.914
  - _text: Especially hot ones.
    _timeStamp: 282.96
  - _text: Not thermodynamically, just in appearance.
    _timeStamp: 285.462
  - _text: That would be me!
